  "result": "Excellent! All 48 tests pass. I've added two new functions to `src/invoices.js`:\n\n**`addLine(invoice, { sku, qty })`** \u2014 adds a line to an invoice or increases qty if the SKU already exists\n- Validates qty and SKU like `createInvoice`\n- Returns NOT_DRAFT if invoice status isn't 'draft'\n- Returns ok(newInvoice) with the updated lines\n\n**`removeLine(invoice, sku)`** \u2014 removes a line from an invoice by SKU\n- Returns LINE_NOT_FOUND if the SKU isn't on the invoice\n- Returns NO_LINES if it would remove the last line\n- Returns NOT_DRAFT if invoice status isn't 'draft'\n- Returns ok(newInvoice) without that line\n\n**Added error codes:** NOT_DRAFT and LINE_NOT_FOUND\n\n**Added 13 comprehensive tests** covering:\n- Adding new lines and updating existing ones\n- Validation of qty and SKU\n- Protection of draft-only status\n- No mutation of original invoices\n- Multiple operations in sequence\n- Edge cases (single line removal, mid-list removal, etc.)\n\nAll 48 tests pass (35 previous + 13 new).",
